Subject: [PATCH 07/14] Fix Anzrag's Rampage defined-X quantity

Parse typed battlefield-to-graveyard counts through ZoneChangeCountThisTurn. This also supports the same quantity wording on Structural Assault.

Analogues: parse_number_of_creatures_died_this_turn and parse_number_of_objects_exiled_under_controller_this_turn. CR 107.3c + 608.2i.
